# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
#
# The fixed state the recovery ISO is built from (README.md, "Reproducible build").
# Each Restow release sets a new snapshot time (security updates) in its release
# commit, so the tag names the exact package state; packages.lock then lists every
# package of that state. Change these three values only together with
# `build.sh --update-lock` and a review of the lock diff.
#
# SNAPSHOT_TIMESTAMP   a time of snapshot.debian.org (main, non-free-firmware and
#                      debian-security of the same time); the archive answers with the
#                      newest snapshot at or before it, and SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH is this time
# DEBIAN_IMAGE_DIGEST  the build container, pinned by digest (the tag trixie-20261020)
# LIVE_BUILD_VERSION   the live-build of that snapshot; the build refuses another one
SNAPSHOT_TIMESTAMP=20261020T000000Z
DEBIAN_IMAGE_DIGEST=debian:trixie@sha256:4c25275446ca371766b8b093c696782eabce06263fccacb8d5d813b3dc44b308
LIVE_BUILD_VERSION=1:20250505+deb13u1
